WEBVTT

00:01:29.395 --> 00:01:30.883
(Laughter)

00:01:32.101 --> 00:01:35.034
And you know what I realized,
right there and then?

00:01:35.418 --> 00:01:36.568
It was not.

00:01:37.561 --> 00:01:40.585
In fact, when I get patients
like this woman,

00:01:40.609 --> 00:01:43.085
I tend to advise not to operate.

00:01:43.665 --> 00:01:45.798
So what made me do it this time?

00:01:47.153 --> 00:01:48.805
Well, you see,

00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:51.065
this prolapse was so delicate,

00:01:51.089 --> 00:01:54.780
I could practically see myself
pulling it out of the nerve root canal

00:01:54.804 --> 00:01:57.280
before she entered the consultation room.

00:01:57.907 --> 00:02:00.907
I have to admit it,
I wanted to operate on her.